  "description": "Doppler store for GM.Secrets — downloads a Doppler config's secrets (REST API, no SDK dependency) and loads them into IConfiguration at startup, with optional periodic reload. DB__PASSWORD maps to Db:Password. With a personal or CLI token the app environment picks the config (Development → dev, Staging → stg, Production → prd). Register with builder.AddGMSecrets(s => s.AddDoppler()) and select with the SECRETS_PROVIDER=Doppler environment variable.",
